<title>MALAYSIA: Commerce Asset to buy insurance stake.</title>
<headline>Commerce Asset to buy insurance stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Asset Holding Bhd said on Monday that it has entered into an agreement with the New Straits Times Press (M) Bhd to buy 30 percent of American Malaysian Life Assurance Sdn Bhd for 36 million ringgit.</p>
<p>Commerce Asset, a financial services firm, said the acquisition would allow it to broaden its earnings base by diversifying into the insurance industry.</p>
<p>Publisher New Straits Times owns 20.12 percent of Commerce Asset through Pitisan Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
